    "description": "Business sales and operations semantic model covering products, categories, suppliers, customers, employees, dates, orders and shipping. Orders is at order grain, while Order_Details is at product-line grain. Use predefined measures for sales, orders, customers, shipping and employee analysis, with Date providing Order, Required and Shipped date roles."
